# builder-snapshot: creates frozen copy without freezing the builder
# After the snapshot, mutations to the builder do not affect the snapshot.
[call [fn [let b]
    [call [fn [let snapshot]
        [snap: snapshot
         final: [builder-finish [builder-set "y" 2 b]]]]
     [builder-snapshot b]]]
 [builder-set "x" 1 [make-builder]]]
=== out
Dict({"snap": Dict({"x": Int(1)}), "final": Dict({"x": Int(1), "y": Int(2)})})
